# Project Rules & Git Workflow

## Git Branching Rules
- **Active Development Branch**: `develop`
- **Production Branch**: `main` (Vercel automatic deployment)

## Workflow Guidelines:
- All active coding, bug fixing, and testing must take place on the `develop` branch.
- Changes are pushed to `origin/develop`.
- Only merge/push to `main` when features are ready to be deployed to live production on Vercel.
